# Content MDX

Project frontmatter must include: `title`, `description`, `type` (commercial|personal|experiment), `status`, `date`, `technologies`, `featured`, `draft`.

- `type: commercial` → case-study sections in body; no confidential internals.
- `type: experiment` → may appear on `/lab` as well as projects index.
- Do not claim shipped features unless `status` supports it.

Writing: `title`, `date`, `description`, `tags`; mark non-real posts with `draft: true` or clear “Example draft” in description.

Tone: concrete engineering language; no résumé clichés.
